Ħruġ ikteb: ['Test object'], linja-ġdida.
>> l := Lista ġdid ; 1 ; ( Lista ġdid ; (Mument ġdid: 1) ; (Int64 minn-test: ['321']) ; (Lista ġdid ; 3)).
Ħruġ ikteb: l, linja-ġdida.
>> old-lst-address := l prototip indirizz-memorja.
l save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
Ħruġ ikteb: ['========== RELOADING SNAP:'], linja-ġdida.
>> b := Oġġett load-from: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
(b prototip indirizz-memorja = old-lst-address) veru: {
	Ħruġ ikteb: ['Object link re-attached.'], linja-ġdida.
}.
Ħruġ ikteb: b, linja-ġdida.
